{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"There are 5 distinct cuts one just under each finger, with one crossing from his pinky down to his thumb","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:34:18.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738902392254496818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I have failed 5 times.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:34:28.005000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738902432305774592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Never again.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:34:32.845000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738902452606074911","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I will never forget my inaction.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:34:52.986000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738902537083551778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“Cato, if I had counted the times I’ve sinned like you did, I’d have as many cuts on my skin as I do stars. We must move forward.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:35:15.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738902632554430465","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I am trying, this boat did not help.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:35:49.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738902773495758909","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“I know. Times on-board this submarine have been dark. We’re almost there, okay?”","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:36:20.717000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738902905054035989","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I know. So close... I won't hurt myself again. I won't ever need to. No one else is dying.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:37:36.905000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738903224609931324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“Cato, people die. Lives are lost. What matters is how we go on. However painful it may be when another’s spark ends, we must not stop stroking our own fire to light the way for the rest.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:38:48.645000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738903525509169182","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"They let go of his hand. “Even if we lose someone else, you can’t keep hurting yourself life that.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:38:52.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738903541762228225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
