{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"(Emotionally)","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:40:14.557000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738903885850083438","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I just feel so much responsibility, especially last night. Navar would have listened to me, but I didn't ask him to stay.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:40:58.529000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738904070282149908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“No, he wouldn’t have. He wouldn’t have stopped for anyone.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:42:41.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738904500131332107","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“We did what we could with what we had. Navar has taught me a lot. One of the things I’ve learned from him is that we mustn’t carry our pain with us. It weighs down our hearts until we can barely crawl. We have to push through. I suspect Navar fought until his last breath, if not to kill the thing, then to forgive himself.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:42:44.302000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738904513926398023","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"How did you do it Arc? Forgive yourself?\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:43:23.620000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738904678837780580","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“It’s different for everybody. I found the light and I clung to it. I acknowledged my past but I swore to change my future. I want to make a change and I want to help people. I saw kindness, and joy, and forgiveness in people, and I turned to it myself. How could you forgive others and live a life as a paragon of light without forgiving your own darknesses?”","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:45:16.871000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738905153847033970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I just feel like I could have done more. It is never enough.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:46:15.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738905401185271809","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"♪  has been listening pensively, silent as usual.","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:46:53.972000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738905561118015568","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“Cato. You did what you did. You did what you could. You can’t change that. What you can change is the future. I know there’s more good in you than three of me. I know you can do this. You are enough. To me, and to everyone. Trust me,” They take his hand and hold it.","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:48:25.871000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738905946570489886","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"Wynne nods in agreement to that.","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:48:46.218000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738906031911862322","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I... really appreciate you three. If one good thing came from this ride, it is that I got closer to all of you. I may falter, but I will try to forgive myself even when the world feels dark.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:50:33.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738906480232628230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“Thank you. Loving oneself is often harder than loving anything else.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T23:51:19.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738906676366934078","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
